  "extract": "The Jin dynasty or the Jin Empire, officially Jin, sometimes distinguished as the Sima Jin or the Two Jins, was an imperial dynasty in China that existed from 266 to 420 CE. It was founded by Sima Yan, posthumously known as Emperor Wu of Jin, who previously served as the regent of the Cao Wei dynasty.",
  "extract_html": "<p>The <b>Jin dynasty</b> or the <b>Jin Empire</b>, officially <b>Jin</b>, sometimes distinguished as the <b>Sima Jin</b> or the <b>Two Jins</b>, was an imperial dynasty in China that existed from 266 to 420 CE. It was founded by Sima Yan, posthumously known as Emperor Wu of Jin, who previously served as the regent of the Cao Wei dynasty.</p>"
